^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\" :question/answer-fields \"6e195de5-18d2-5700-a7e5-20c251a0b310\"] [:db/ensure \"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\"] [:db/add \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/id #uuid \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\"] [:db/add \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{9}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/id #uuid \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\"] [:db/add \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/id #uuid \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\"] [:db/add \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/id #uuid \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\"] [:db/add \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer