x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 x e^{x^{2} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f683ddb0-84e3-50e0-a81b-3326e5f6bc7b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"f683ddb0-84e3-50e0-a81b-3326e5f6bc7b\" :question/answer-fields \"a6665a5f-115a-5d15-bc12-154b5e80da9e\"] [:db/ensure \"f683ddb0-84e3-50e0-a81b-3326e5f6bc7b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"f683ddb0-84e3-50e0-a81b-3326e5f6bc7b\"] [:db/add \"9ceed5d4-063b-5022-b5a2-3ec0e1b01997\" :answer/id #uuid \"9ceed5d4-063b-5022-b5a2-3ec0e1b01997\"] [:db/add \"9ceed5d4-063b-5022-b5a2-3ec0e1b01997\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9ceed5d4-063b-5022-b5a2-3ec0e1b01997\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9ceed5d4-063b-5022-b5a2-3ec0e1b01997\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"85ee1095-6cd5-58cc-b27a-8cdfe548926e\" :answer/id #uuid \"85ee1095-6cd5-58cc-b27a-8cdfe548926e\"] [:db/add \"85ee1095-6cd5-58cc-b27a-8cdfe548926e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"85ee1095-6cd5-58cc-b27a-8cdfe548926e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"85ee1095-6cd5-58cc-b27a-8cdfe548926e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"050f77a2-b736-598d-a531-1503910bfb8d\" :answer/id #uuid \"050f77a2-b736-598d-a531-1503910bfb8d\"] [:db/add \"050f77a2-b736-598d-a531-1503910bfb8d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"050f77a2-b736-598d-a531-1503910bfb8d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{16}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"050f77a2-b736-598d-a531-1503910bfb8d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bb2b611a-f642-5149-a719-c6c7840bb45f\" :answer/id