. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/answer-fields \"b21e997c-d880-5072-a778-978cbaf10f45\"] [:db/ensure \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\"] [:db/add \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/id #uuid \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\"] [:db/add \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/id #uuid \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\"] [:db/add \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/id #uuid \"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\"] [:db/add \"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/value \"-6\\\\left