:question/id #uuid \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\"] [:db/add \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=x^{2}$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 x e^{x^{2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 x e^{x^{2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\" :question/answer-fields \"641c291f-40f9-5323-8c64-137180244dc0\"] [:db/ensure \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"1c532141-d138-5ec4-b189-819918ee1f6e\"] [:db/add \"993db0fc-b0a5-536a-8aeb-1c1bbf61c6a3\" :answer/id #uuid \"993db0fc-b0a5-536a-8aeb-1c1bbf61c6a3\"] [:db/add \"993db0fc-b0a5-536a-8aeb-1c1bbf61c6a3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"993db0fc-b0a5-536a-8aeb-1c1bbf61c6a3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"993db0fc-b0a5-536a-8aeb-1c1bbf61c6a3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"11c9f229-11e6-5bfc-a180-13ae2f44170f\" :answer/id #uuid \"11c9f229-11e6-5bfc-a180-13ae2f44170f\"] [:db/add \"11c9f229-11e6-5bfc-a180-13ae2f44170f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"11c9f229-11e6-5bfc-a180-13ae2f44170f\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"11c9f229-11e6-5bfc-a180-13ae2f44170f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"eed0a687-a580-5ffc-a2b4-03ebb2dda122\" :answer/id #uuid \"eed0a687-a580-5ffc-a2b4-03ebb2dda122\"] [:db/add \"eed0a687-a580-5ffc-a2b4