c780-5a46-9191-0d504de5dfce\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/id #uuid \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\"] [:db/add \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=x^{3} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/answer-fields \"8d87053d-c780-5a46-9191-0d504de5dfce\"] [:db/ensure \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"f3489ea1-dc59-5095-9fbb-75a3e5dfc94e\"] [:db/add \"cdf5a320-3e0a-508e-93d1-271f6f3c1656\" :answer/id #uuid \"cdf5a320-3e0a-508e-93d1-271f6f3c1656\"] [:db/add \"cdf5a320-3e0a-508e-93d1-271f6f3c1656\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cdf5a320-3e0a-508e-93d1-271f6f3c1656\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cdf5a320-3e0a-508e-93d1-271f6f3c1656\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e6bb703c-4a82-5658-b9de-057b5ee84977\" :answer/id #uuid \"e6bb703c-4a82-5658-b9de-057b5ee84977\"] [:db/add \"e6bb703c-4a82-5658-b9de-057b5ee84977\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e6bb703c-4a82-5658-b9de-057b5ee84977\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e6bb703c-4a82-5658-b9de-057b5ee84977\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0a3ec117-9cd9-5059-b704-25f5b9d239a5\" 