ng the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int x e^{x^{2} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\" :question/answer-fields \"6e195de5-18d2-5700-a7e5-20c251a0b310\"] [17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"8f321ac9-ee74-5d56-a034-80aecb67e54f\"] [\"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/id #uuid \"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\"] [\"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"be3d7f99-086d-5b94-afab-5cb5a14ed0e6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{9}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/id #uuid \"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\"] [\"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"32b95c86-eb1b-5e30-8ac5-a38e83242ea2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/id #uuid \"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\"] [\"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7c42cf8e-38d3-5f28-a720-17bd91b1b88c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/id #uuid \"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\"] [\"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7951e778-1fad-54ee-b50e-2cc6c1e57abe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"2a67574d-88b6-5167-ac1b-035ed5117b61\" :answer/id #uuid \"2a67574d-88b6-5167-ac1b-035ed5117b61\"] [\"2a67574d-88b6-5167-ac1b-035ed5117b61\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2a67574d-88