stion/problem \"Use the substitution $u=x^{3} + 3$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\" :question/answer-fields \"b21e997c-d880-5072-a778-978cbaf10f45\"] [17592186184349 :knowledge-point/questions \"594711aa-d418-5e91-9b45-4f9d6db0f503\"] [\"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/id #uuid \"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\"] [\"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d1529364-8124-5a8a-a0e5-450acecef6d5\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/id #uuid \"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\"] [\"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"37a4c805-75a4-5ce9-920a-942c86137b95\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/id #uuid \"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\"] [\"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4decc04a-6235-5391-a75b-0cfdf5e04696\" :answer/value \"-6\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"c9bec2b3-1b31-5d67-8f8b-e380f437e886\" :answer/id #uuid \"c9bec2b3-1b31-5d67-8f8b-e380f437e886\"] [\"c9bec2b3-1b31-5d67-8f8b-e380f437e886\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c9bec2b3-1b31-5d67-8f8b-e380f437e886\" :answ