es\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(e^{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(e^{x^{3} + 1}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186679278 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"cbc3a831-f582-5a3b-8016-0dcdfb035e2e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(e^{3 - x^{2}}\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186679287}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"cbc3a831-f582-5a3b-8016-0dcdfb035e2e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(e^{3 - x^{2}}\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186679287} :answer-field/id #uuid \"652bd61e-0e58-5a98-bedf-e549f8c598b4\" :answer-field/key \"answer\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186679246}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"b5d86a9f-bdbe-5022-a3bc-edac0eed87f0\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 x e^{3 - x^{2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - x^{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(- 2 x)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 x e^{3 - x^{2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(e^{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(e^{3 - x^{2}}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186679281 :question/answer-fields [{: